# TemanKu sound effects (audio/sound_service.dart, audio/app_sound_service.dart)
#
# correct.wav, try_again.wav, session_complete.wav — plain PCM WAV, not MP3.
# AppSoundService.play* fails silently on any of these being missing,
# corrupt, or unplayable, same as it would for any other asset error.
#
# Design constraints these files must satisfy (§ sound design, SimpleTEA's
# "encouraging not repressive" principle — see sound_service.dart's doc
# comment for the full rationale):
#   - correct.wav and try_again.wav must be TONALLY EQUIVALENT: same
#     instrument family, same warmth, similar (short) duration. Distinct
#     enough to be informative (different pitch/pattern), but neither may
#     sound like a punishment or an alarm — think "two friendly chimes," not
#     "success fanfare vs. error buzzer".
#   - session_complete.wav: calm, no fanfare, no "you win" register — same
#     no-celebration tone as widgets/mastery_closure_prompt.dart's copy.
#   - Every file under ~1 second, soft attack/decay — no sudden loud onset.
#   - No looping — these are one-shot chimes, never background music.
#
# No code change needed as the audio content changes — the loader just plays
# whatever's actually in this folder. A code change is only needed if the
# file *format* changes (AppSoundService's asset paths are format-specific).
